Error [E3410]: `core.files.read()` is a Tier-2 comptime effect — it requires a `#Impure` gate
  --> tests/ui/comptime_io_rejected.jet:4:20
    |
  4 | comptime data = fs.read("config.txt")
    |                    ^^^^
 Why: ambient I/O (filesystem, environment, process) is not allowed in pure comptime evaluation
 Fix: wrap the comptime binding in `#Impure("reason") { … }` and pass `--allow-impure` to the build

Error [E0107]: nothing named `data` exists here
  --> tests/ui/comptime_io_rejected.jet:7:11
    |
  7 |     print(data)
    |           ^^^^
 Why: a name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: add `use core.data as data`
